    "name": "Pacifish: Recast",
    "steam_appid": 3398200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pacifish: Recast is an incremental fishing management game with many mechanics to interact with and improve. It can be played both idly, or more actively to progress faster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish - Acquire and equip poles and tackle to fish in 6 unlockable areas with different fish and materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight - Disturbing the waters causes both the fish and the materials to fight back. Earn pixels to increase fighting stats and progress to higher tiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch - Set up and upgrade incubators to hatch large quantities of fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat - Consume those large quantities to improve stats such as fishing speed and fight stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim - Manually take control of a fish to eat other fish and gain resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble - Spend your earned coin to play slots, or test your memory in a match game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft - Use materials to craft new poles and tackle, as well as create mods to alter pole stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish the moon - Upgrade the Sky Rod to increase moon fishing ability, destroy the moon to get permanent bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recast is a remake of Pacifish, with added features and a complete rebalance. It uses a new engine and save system. Previous Pacifish save games are not compatible.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pacifish: Recast is an incremental fishing management game with many mechanics to interact with and improve. It can be played both idly, or more actively to progress faster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish - Acquire and equip poles and tackle to fish in 6 unlockable areas with different fish and materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight - Disturbing the waters causes both the fish and the materials to fight back. Earn pixels to increase fighting stats and progress to higher tiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch - Set up and upgrade incubators to hatch large quantities of fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat - Consume those large quantities to improve stats such as fishing speed and fight stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim - Manually take control of a fish to eat other fish and gain resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble - Spend your earned coin to play slots, or test your memory in a match game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft - Use materials to craft new poles and tackle, as well as create mods to alter pole stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish the moon - Upgrade the Sky Rod to increase moon fishing ability, destroy the moon to get permanent bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Recast is a remake of Pacifish, with added features and a complete rebalance. It uses a new engine and save system. Previous Pacifish save games are not compatible.</i></p>",
